/// Hindi <-> Santali (Ol Chiki) word list for the Dictionary feature.
///
/// Generated by translating a curated list of common classroom/everyday
/// Hindi words through the same verified Hindi->Santali MT pipeline used
/// by HindiSantaliMtService (see models/indic_translate), run offline via
/// the reference Python implementation for batch generation.
///
/// A handful of generated entries were dropped after review: some produced
/// wrong-script output (Perso-Arabic or Meitei Mayek characters leaking
/// into what should be Ol Chiki text) and some collapsed semantically
/// distinct words to an identical translation (e.g. 'brother' and 'sister'
/// both decoding to the same string) -- both are known failure modes of
/// running a sentence-level MT model on isolated, decontextualized single
/// words. No native-speaker verification has been done on the entries that
/// were kept; treat this as a best-effort offline reference, not an
/// authoritative dictionary.
